- A tag is just a node
  notes: |
    TODO — open the tags taxonomy and show a tag's own page — a grid of everything filed
    under it, gathered from across the tree. No tag table, no special store.
  - |
    A tag is an ordinary node; its **page** is a grid of everything filed under it.
